s a code object as a Python value (the IR's {:code ...} constants)."] [77 1 "// Module is a module: its name and namespace."] [81 2 "// Cls is a subclass of module this module is an instance of (six's _LazyModule, queue 205), nil for module itself"] [83 2 "// slots are a subclass's __slots__' values (queue 226)"] [94 1 "// builtinFuncModules are the built-in modules' functions' modules (PY6d's REQUEST: a function's __module__,"] [95 1 "// CPython's m_module, which pickle saves it by)."] [112 4 "// method_vectorcall's check: a method descriptor called with its instance first"] [121 37 "// one allocation (queue 210: append grew it a second time)"] [126 4 "// method_check_args (PY7: dict.update() was a Go panic, test_ordered_dict's"] [127 4 "// CPythonBuiltinDictTests.test_update)"] [134 2 "// meth_richcompare: the same function of the same object; meth_hash not from the object's own hash"] [154 62 "// meth_repr"] [159 2 "// method_descriptor (queue 286): called as a method descriptor is (BuiltinType's call slot checks the instance),"] [160 2 "// method_repr, method_get (descr_check: the instance's type, the class's own as the class is asked), descr_reduce"] [190 2 "// builtin_function_or_method's __module__ (PY6d's REQUEST): a module's function's module, a builtin's"] [191 2 "// \"builtins\", else None (pickle's whichmodule then finds the function in sys.modules)"] [192 2 "// a built-in method named like a slot (a generator's __next__) has the slot wrapper's doc (typeobject.c's slotdefs)"] [216 2 "// methodobject.c's meth_reduce (PY6d's REQUEST: pickle saves a built-in function by name): a function's"] [217 2 "// qualified name, a bound method as getattr(self, name)"] [233 3 "// CPython's \"at 0x...\", the address an identity number (asyncio's Handle reprs and their tests: PY6h's"] [234 3 "// REQUEST, queue 200)"] [243 2 "// cell([contents]): Objects/cellobject.c's cell_new, cell_repr and cell_richcompare (queue 205f: annotationlib's"] [244 2 "// _build_closure makes the stringifiers' cells)"] [265 35 "// tp_richcompare without tp_hash: hash() refuses a cell"] [275 3 "// empty cells come before anything else (cell_compare_impl)"] [301 3 "// module_repr: importlib's _module_repr once importlib is the import system (PY6b's request)"] [307 4 "// importlib's _module_repr: a module with a location is \"from\" it"] [312 2 "// module(name, doc=None), CPython's module_init; a subclass's instance (queue 205: six's _MovedItems) made empty"] [313 2 "// as new_module makes it, its __init__ (module.__init__ through super()) filling it"] [336 2 "// module_new: an uninitialized module (its dict empty), any arguments; module_init fills it"] [352 2 "// module_getsets: __annotations__ and __annotate__ (PEP 649), data descriptors before the dict"] [357 38 "// a subclass's instance: its class's data descriptors first"] [385 4 "// a subclass's instance: the generic lookup (its class's descriptors around the dict), then the"] [386 4 "// dict's __getattr__ (module_getattro)"] [401 23 "// PY6a (enum's global_enum): module_getattro's data descriptors first"] [411 5 "// 3.15 (queue 239, _Py_module_getattro_impl): a lazy import's placeholder reified in the module's dict"] [416 3 "// the type's methods (__dir__, __repr__ ...), then the module's __getattr__ (PEP 562)"] [421 4 "// a pending submodule of a lazy import (_PyImport_TryLoadLazySubmodule), then the dict again"] [437 5 "// module_get_resolved_dict_item: a lazy __getattr__ reified, unless it is resolving"] [450 2 "// module.__dir__ (module_dir, queue 223: traceback's suggestions call it): the dict's __dir__ function called,"] [451 2 "// else the dict's keys"] [471 1 "// functionNew is function(code, globals, name=None, argdefs=None, closure=None, kwdefaults=None), types.FunctionType"] [472 1 "// called: Objects/funcobject.c's func_new (its clinic's argument checks, then func_new_impl's in its order, and their"] [473 1 "// messages) over PyFunction_New (the code's name, qualname and docstring, the globals' __name__ as __module__, the"] [474 1 "// builtins from the globals' __builtins__). Queue 205f: annotationlib's FORWARDREF and STRING formats call an"] [475 1 "// __annotate__'s code with a _StringifierDict as its globals (typing.NamedTuple's annotated classes, pip's import)."] [541 2 "// _PyEval_BuiltinsFromGlobals: the globals' __builtins__ (a module its dict), else the running frame's"] [561 19 "// PyFunction_EVENT_CREATE (queue 274)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[100 58] [101 39] [116 26] [128 27] [154 34] [171 21] [194 23] [195 32] [203 31] [206 36] [210 58] [227 34] [246 38] [249 41] [302 42] [306 47] [344 28] [388 32] [394 41] [409 39] [410 32] [417 51] [427 41] [428 34] [435 40] [436 33] [442 79] [464 30] [489 12] [489 19] [498 31] [504 34] [510 34] [518 37] [531 29] [534 12] [534 19] [542 40] [543 26] [545 31] [550 26]]} (go/file "func.go" :imports [])

